  "bio": "Nestled in the vibrant Excelsior District of San Francisco, JC Tattoo specializes in exquisite lettering, intricate black & gray, and bold tribal designs. With a reputation for artistic excellence and a warm, inviting studio atmosphere, JC Tattoo is the go-to destination for those seeking to turn their body into a canvas of remarkable artistry. Visit us on Mission Street or call to book your session – our doors are open daily from noon to seven.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: San Francisco, California, United States"
